[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4750.229, "timestamp": "01:19:10", "text": "等等，我還活著。好的。  哦，那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4759.11, "timestamp": "01:19:19", "text": "為什麼說是翻滾發射？我已經拿走了。對不起。  呃，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4767.91, "timestamp": "01:19:27", "text": "會推它。不用擔心。鋼。  好了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4768.75, "timestamp": "01:19:28", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4770.55, "timestamp": "01:19:30", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4772.149, "timestamp": "01:19:32", "text": "呃，對了，既然你們兩個的生命值都"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4773.43, "timestamp": "01:19:33", "text": "很低，記得要利用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4776.63, "timestamp": "01:19:36", "text": "遊戲漏洞。送我上去。給我寄一塊。  請。我應該"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4779.91, "timestamp": "01:19:39", "text": "進行健康升級嗎？  堅持，稍等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4782.83, "timestamp": "01:19:42", "text": "。堅持，稍等。你想問什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4785.43, "timestamp": "01:19:45", "text": "你去哪了，羅科？我在這裡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4788.63, "timestamp": "01:19:48", "text": "。  我在這裡。好的。我幫你準備了一個設備。  那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4791.43, "timestamp": "01:19:51", "text": "是什麼？  好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4793.23, "timestamp": "01:19:53", "text": "。看。了解一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4794.83, "timestamp": "01:19:54", "text": "[音樂]"}]